# Public-repo confidentiality

This repository is public. Do not reference anything internal to the Vector Charts or Zydro platforms, their customers, users, or competitors, unless a developer explicitly confirms it is allowed.

Allowed without confirmation: essential public API surface the CLI must call or document (public endpoints, request/response fields the CLI uses, install URLs, and user-facing product names).

Forbidden without explicit confirmation:

- Internal service, environment, hostname, or infra names
- Non-public architecture, roadmaps, or APIs
- Customer, user, or competitor identities/names
- Private emails or non-essential company/org internals

If unsure whether something is essential public API surface, ask before adding it.
